		{
			"id":"85fa9c9ec2a18bf3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## intro paper prototype\nCan you close your eyes?\nImagine you're sitting in a small room to your left there is a door.\nIn front of you is your desk, on it is a pinup board, a lamp, a microphone and most importantly a pc, with a program that is open.\nyou can open your eyes.\nyou remember your promotion and how you wanted a small office to work better.\neventually they changed the janitors closet to an office.\nThe police don't have much money.\nso this was already a lot.",
